WEBVTT

00:00:23.855 --> 00:00:26.895
♪ When this moment come to us ♪

00:00:26.917 --> 00:00:29.286
♪ The Stars will always shine ♪
[Full-Time Magister 3]

00:00:29.701 --> 00:00:33.541
♪ The light travels through
the horizon to you ♪

00:00:33.586 --> 00:00:35.913
♪ Right now light it up
follow your heart, yeah ♪

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:48.666
♪ Our dream of madness is rattling ♪

00:00:48.667 --> 00:00:50.662
♪ Just cause you feel it possible ♪

00:00:50.714 --> 00:00:55.208
♪ My eyes will open wide
in this cold, dark night ♪

00:00:55.789 --> 00:00:58.425
♪ The heart bound by time
is just a shackle ♪

00:00:58.426 --> 00:01:00.576
♪ You said that dreams will never fall ♪

00:01:00.577 --> 00:01:03.835
♪ You put on the wings for me ♪

00:01:03.865 --> 00:01:07.997
♪ Braving through the wind ♪

00:01:09.532 --> 00:01:12.316
♪ When this moment comes to us ♪

00:01:12.328 --> 00:01:14.628
♪ My heart will no longer be lost ♪

00:01:15.205 --> 00:01:19.342
♪ I carry the weight of stars
and moon as I search for you ♪

00:01:19.368 --> 00:01:21.768
♪ You summon me from the dream ♪

00:01:21.769 --> 00:01:24.817
♪ My ambition is burning on ♪

00:01:24.818 --> 00:01:27.441
♪ You are the hope of light
in my darkest night ♪

00:01:27.442 --> 00:01:29.036
♪ On the other end of shine ♪

00:01:29.037 --> 00:01:31.555
♪ Let it all out and fight ♪

00:01:31.556 --> 00:01:34.677
♪ Shine bright like
it's the end of the world ♪

00:01:34.755 --> 00:01:37.236
♪ The Stars is burning through the sky ♪

00:01:37.237 --> 00:01:39.107
♪ Your hands are now ♪

00:01:39.108 --> 00:01:40.641
♪ Burning ♪

00:01:40.989 --> 00:01:44.680
♪ Fight against all odds
of our generation ♪

00:01:45.925 --> 00:01:49.893
♪ Fight against all odds
of our generation ♪

00:01:50.747 --> 00:01:53.361
♪ Fight against all odds
of our generation ♪

00:02:14.967 --> 00:02:16.892
Sir, I've checked this out.

00:02:16.982 --> 00:02:19.105
These Parasitic Monsters
are called Scaly Monsters.

00:02:19.319 --> 00:02:22.597
They're controlled by the Scaly Queen.
They can't infect people in the past.

00:02:23.140 --> 00:02:27.377
Now, it may be a genetic mutation.
And they've evolved into something new.

00:02:28.387 --> 00:02:29.600
Mutation?

00:02:30.347 --> 00:02:31.532
There must be a reason for that.

00:02:32.599 --> 00:02:34.239
Who caused the mutation?

00:02:35.826 --> 00:02:36.730
These monsters,

00:02:36.903 --> 00:02:40.915
will commit suicide if they
know they don't stand a chance.

00:02:41.022 --> 00:02:42.996
And they'll send their energy
to the Scaly Queen.

00:02:43.483 --> 00:02:46.818
Their hosts will die together
with them when they do that.

00:02:47.838 --> 00:02:50.226
It means that
we can't be careless now.

00:02:51.232 --> 00:02:54.983
At least we must not let
Scaly Queen discover our plot.

00:03:13.771 --> 00:03:15.207
Purification!

00:03:28.579 --> 00:03:30.419
I shouldn't waste my mana.

00:03:30.632 --> 00:03:32.952
You can kill them with
a low-level magic like that?

00:03:34.139 --> 00:03:36.311
The Parasitic Monsters
are weak against light.

00:03:36.805 --> 00:03:38.950
Fan Mo, you've found a good partner.

00:03:39.747 --> 00:03:41.151
I should call you Mo Fan.

00:03:41.323 --> 00:03:42.189
You liar!

00:03:43.888 --> 00:03:45.115
I understand now.

00:03:50.049 --> 00:03:51.209
Be careful!

00:04:25.814 --> 00:04:28.049
Storming Ice!

00:04:50.393 --> 00:04:51.939
You're a level-2 mage too.

00:04:52.255 --> 00:04:54.375
Why didn't you join
the Battle of freshmen?

00:04:55.255 --> 00:04:57.492
I'm a mage who uses Light Magic.
That's useless.

00:04:57.712 --> 00:04:59.598
And why should
I take away your glory?

00:05:01.709 --> 00:05:03.359
What kind of monsters are these?

00:05:03.682 --> 00:05:06.602
How can they turn the girls
into monsters?

00:05:06.954 --> 00:05:08.591
It's a parasitic monster
that can infect people.

00:05:09.128 --> 00:05:11.527
Many people in the stadium
were infected by them.

00:05:13.648 --> 00:05:14.501
Does the school know this?

00:05:15.714 --> 00:05:18.114
Yeah. The school will
make their move soon.

00:05:18.955 --> 00:05:19.622
That's good.

00:05:21.308 --> 00:05:22.836
Did you guys hear anything?

00:05:23.009 --> 00:05:25.107
-I think it's the autogates.
-Mo Fan.

00:05:25.509 --> 00:05:27.482
The exits of the stadium are closed.

00:05:28.132 --> 00:05:28.972
Closed?

00:05:29.417 --> 00:05:31.217
The school and the Hunters' League
made that decision.

00:05:31.284 --> 00:05:33.995
They don't want to let anybody
that's infected get out of there.

00:05:34.090 --> 00:05:35.340
Otherwise, there'll be
serious consequences.

00:05:36.184 --> 00:05:38.357
That's why they plan to quarantine them.

00:05:39.161 --> 00:05:40.308
What the hell?

00:05:46.597 --> 00:05:47.677
What should we do?

00:05:47.946 --> 00:05:50.653
Most of the mages inside
are Orbit-level mages.

00:05:50.983 --> 00:05:55.510
They can't win against
the Parasitic Monsters.

00:05:56.199 --> 00:05:56.972
Mr. Li,

00:05:57.181 --> 00:05:59.501
there are around six to
seven thousand students inside.

00:05:59.820 --> 00:06:02.540
We don't know the exact number
of infected people.

00:06:03.342 --> 00:06:05.062
If this becomes a tragedy,

00:06:05.128 --> 00:06:07.224
we can't afford
to take the responsibility.

00:06:07.879 --> 00:06:09.999
We can't do anything but watch?

00:06:10.026 --> 00:06:10.626
Yeah.

00:06:10.666 --> 00:06:13.684
Besides the quarantine,
is there nothing else we can do?

00:06:14.476 --> 00:06:16.896
We must kill the Scaly Queen.
When it dies,

00:06:17.043 --> 00:06:19.709
all her soldiers will die as well.

00:06:20.872 --> 00:06:22.492
How is the Scaly Queen power?

00:06:28.535 --> 00:06:29.335
Girl,

00:06:29.444 --> 00:06:30.937
you should not be here.

00:06:31.850 --> 00:06:33.330
Ling Ling? Why are you here?

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:37.482
You didn't alert the monsters
when you closed the exits, right?

00:06:38.133 --> 00:06:38.746
Don't worry.

00:06:39.066 --> 00:06:40.360
We're very cautious with our actions.

00:06:40.861 --> 00:06:44.181
If it weren't for the Scaly Queen,
we would have already rushed in .

00:06:44.989 --> 00:06:48.697
Low-level monsters like these are
worthless in front of us.

00:06:50.256 --> 00:06:52.642
Isn't this the prodigy hunter,
Ling Ling?

00:06:53.061 --> 00:06:53.755
Girl.

00:06:54.115 --> 00:06:55.248
Do you have any good ideas?

00:06:58.318 --> 00:07:00.878
my partner and I
dealt with two of them before.

00:07:01.164 --> 00:07:03.257
The male monster was killed then.

00:07:03.499 --> 00:07:05.553
I think the Scaly Queen
inside the stadium...

00:07:05.673 --> 00:07:07.493
was the female monster
that got away last time.

00:07:10.615 --> 00:07:11.655
Based on my observations,

00:07:11.800 --> 00:07:13.933
the red spots are moving irregularly...

00:07:13.947 --> 00:07:14.946
and killing everyone,

00:07:15.138 --> 00:07:18.072
but some of the female monsters
will stay in the stadium.

00:07:19.450 --> 00:07:20.304
This is...

00:07:20.947 --> 00:07:22.814
It's the stage lift of the stadium.

00:07:26.281 --> 00:07:28.281
Usually, it's suspended in the air

00:07:28.454 --> 00:07:29.908
And it's covered with protective net.

00:07:30.254 --> 00:07:31.841
We don't use this much.

00:07:32.477 --> 00:07:33.037
Oh yeah.

00:07:33.278 --> 00:07:34.756
The concert will use
this mechanism today.

00:07:35.250 --> 00:07:37.819
-How do we get there?
-There's a path on the third floor.

00:07:37.953 --> 00:07:39.745
We can enter the stage from there.

00:07:41.433 --> 00:07:42.006
Ling Ling.

00:07:42.452 --> 00:07:46.184
Are you saying that the Scaly Queen
is hiding inside now?

00:07:47.135 --> 00:07:49.828
Can we get an overview
of the stadium from there?

00:07:50.873 --> 00:07:51.633
Yes.

00:07:51.873 --> 00:07:52.794
We must move now.

00:07:52.946 --> 00:07:54.972
We must send someone
to kill the Scaly Queen.

00:07:55.789 --> 00:07:56.389
No.

00:07:56.652 --> 00:07:58.479
The Scaly Queen is intelligent.

00:07:59.036 --> 00:08:01.609
It is hiding at a high spot
because it wants to get an overview as well.

00:08:01.880 --> 00:08:04.101
It'll discover us
if we just walk in without preparation.

00:08:04.867 --> 00:08:05.680
What should we do then?

00:08:05.954 --> 00:08:07.472
We can't just wait here!

00:08:07.807 --> 00:08:08.434
Ling Ling.

00:08:08.780 --> 00:08:11.605
Who's your partner
that killed the male monster?

00:08:12.307 --> 00:08:13.040
It's Mo Fan.

00:08:13.214 --> 00:08:14.712
He's in the stadium now,
trying to save people.

00:08:15.786 --> 00:08:17.720
Your partner should be quite strong.

00:08:18.070 --> 00:08:19.870
We should send him
to deal with the Scaly Queen.

00:08:26.471 --> 00:08:27.617
You're amazing!

00:08:27.711 --> 00:08:30.376
We can't deal with them
even if we work together.

00:08:30.603 --> 00:08:32.643
But you killed many of them by yourself.

00:08:33.543 --> 00:08:34.423
It's just my job.

00:08:34.496 --> 00:08:36.298
Girls are meant to be protected.

00:08:37.805 --> 00:08:39.853
Stop flirting.
Think of a way to get out.

00:08:40.966 --> 00:08:41.779
Mo Fan!

00:08:42.454 --> 00:08:43.227
What's wrong?

00:08:43.717 --> 00:08:44.464
Here it is .

00:08:44.668 --> 00:08:46.175
There's a Scaly Queen
hiding inside the stadium.

00:08:46.708 --> 00:08:47.969
Scaly Queen?

00:08:47.970 --> 00:08:49.368
What are you talking about?

00:08:49.902 --> 00:08:51.142
There's no time to explain!

00:08:51.308 --> 00:08:53.348
If the Scaly Queen is desperate,

00:08:53.523 --> 00:08:55.589
everyone that has been infected
will be in danger!

00:08:56.635 --> 00:08:58.008
Ask the hunters to come then!

00:08:59.062 --> 00:09:00.957
They're here.
Even the Hunter King is here.

00:09:01.301 --> 00:09:02.487
But they can't enter the stadium.

00:09:02.627 --> 00:09:05.119
The school is cautious
with their actions too.

00:09:05.120 --> 00:09:08.091
They're finding a discreet entrance that the Scaly Queen won't notice.

00:09:09.958 --> 00:09:12.586
What kind of expression is that?
Is it something serious?

00:09:24.712 --> 00:09:25.379
Mo Fan.

00:09:26.468 --> 00:09:28.923
Everyone hopes that
you can kill the Scaly Queen.

00:09:29.437 --> 00:09:30.223
Me?

00:09:30.978 --> 00:09:31.724
How is it?

00:09:31.731 --> 00:09:32.730
He agreed on it.

00:09:33.030 --> 00:09:34.830
In exchange of this,

00:09:34.843 --> 00:09:37.101
he wants the school to reward him
with something good.

00:09:38.256 --> 00:09:38.950
Fine.

00:09:39.510 --> 00:09:42.103
I would be worried
if other student attempted this.

00:09:42.623 --> 00:09:43.583
Mo Fan.

00:09:43.916 --> 00:09:45.558
I'm confident in his abilities.

00:09:54.703 --> 00:09:56.757
Leta student to fight
against the Scaly Queen?

00:09:56.823 --> 00:09:58.197
This is absurd!

00:09:58.402 --> 00:10:01.962
If it's hunting down monsters,
we're the pros here.

00:10:02.848 --> 00:10:05.073
I think this decision is unwise too.

00:10:05.613 --> 00:10:06.713
Have you found the entrance?

00:10:07.013 --> 00:10:07.839
-No.
-No.

00:10:08.826 --> 00:10:09.849
Continue your search.

00:10:14.585 --> 00:10:15.650
Where are we going?

00:10:16.094 --> 00:10:17.440
Third floor! The stage lift!

00:10:20.337 --> 00:10:22.176
Zhao Man Yan, I'm not looking down on you.

00:10:22.325 --> 00:10:24.470
Your Light Magic works on the monsters,

00:10:24.770 --> 00:10:27.190
but there'll be harder monsters
to deal with on the third floor.

00:10:27.676 --> 00:10:29.864
And you have to be precise
with your magic with them.

00:10:30.070 --> 00:10:31.623
You can't kill the hosts,

00:10:31.624 --> 00:10:33.083
and you need to defeat them too.

00:10:33.670 --> 00:10:36.905
I'll hand the monsters to you.
I'll take on the others.

00:10:37.732 --> 00:10:38.372
Fine.

00:10:38.639 --> 00:10:40.093
Mo Fan, let me say this first.

00:10:40.279 --> 00:10:41.444
You're in for the money.
I'm in for the fame.

00:10:41.964 --> 00:10:44.648
But I'll run away
if it gets too dangerous.

00:10:45.061 --> 00:10:46.212
I'll do my best.

00:10:46.341 --> 00:10:47.847
But it doesn't mean
that I'll sacrifice myself.

00:10:49.816 --> 00:10:50.496
Let's go.

00:10:57.423 --> 00:10:58.397
Wait.

00:10:58.477 --> 00:10:59.997
You're in for the fame?
What do you mean?

00:11:00.882 --> 00:11:01.695
To be honest,

00:11:01.815 --> 00:11:02.923
I'm from the Zhao family.

00:11:03.597 --> 00:11:06.355
My family is as renowned
as the Mu family.

00:11:06.748 --> 00:11:08.709
But not all of the family members
live up to the name.

00:11:09.395 --> 00:11:11.991
We need to be outstanding and
to attract talented people as well.

00:11:13.251 --> 00:11:15.550
If I'm able to solve this crisis,

00:11:15.700 --> 00:11:19.093
and raise my family's reputation,
I would be cherished by the family.

00:11:19.879 --> 00:11:21.442
The battle between the noble families
are complicated.

00:11:21.938 --> 00:11:24.409
I don't care about the fame.
Since my name is notorious already.

00:11:24.682 --> 00:11:26.440
Even if I solve this crisis today,

00:11:26.487 --> 00:11:28.286
I guess, at most, it just rids of my charges.

00:11:29.133 --> 00:11:29.649
Fine.

00:11:29.789 --> 00:11:31.947
If we solve this crisis today,
the credit will be yours.

00:11:32.774 --> 00:11:33.773
saying yes so quick?

00:11:34.357 --> 00:11:36.687
I'll give you the things you want too.
Give me a price.

00:11:36.807 --> 00:11:39.350
Then to be bluntly,
I want a Winged Magic Tool.

00:11:39.382 --> 00:11:40.062
How's that?

00:11:42.167 --> 00:11:43.615
You can go alone then.

00:11:45.218 --> 00:11:46.511
How about a Soul Thunder Seed?

00:11:46.810 --> 00:11:48.357
If not, I'll go alone then.

00:11:48.450 --> 00:11:49.853
You can't fight anyway.

00:11:50.028 --> 00:11:51.428
I can protect myself as well.

00:11:52.961 --> 00:11:54.594
It's in the tens of millions.

00:11:55.332 --> 00:11:56.512
You're very daring.

00:11:57.144 --> 00:11:57.931
Is that a deal?

00:12:00.262 --> 00:12:01.356
Deal.

00:12:03.502 --> 00:12:05.773
If you want the Winged Magic Tool,
go and join the Hunters' Game.

00:12:06.326 --> 00:12:07.158
It's held every four years.

00:12:07.284 --> 00:12:08.717
The reward is the most...

00:12:08.806 --> 00:12:10.492
The third floor
is full with red spots now.

00:12:10.561 --> 00:12:12.589
And you guys have the time
to discuss about the rewards?

00:12:12.590 --> 00:12:14.667
You guys are childish! Go now!

00:13:29.561 --> 00:13:30.560
Faster!

00:13:30.563 --> 00:13:33.483
All the monsters
are gathering around here.

00:13:42.045 --> 00:13:43.038
We're almost there.

00:13:43.065 --> 00:13:44.241
You must kill the Scaly Queen.

00:13:44.695 --> 00:13:46.842
If not, you'll be surrounded by them.

00:13:46.923 --> 00:13:49.084
And you guys would be dead by then.

00:13:50.778 --> 00:13:52.361
Mo Fan, aren't you scared?

00:13:53.933 --> 00:13:55.653
I've been through much worse.

00:13:55.760 --> 00:13:56.849
This is nothing.

00:14:04.911 --> 00:14:05.857
They're all infected!

00:14:16.395 --> 00:14:17.568
I'll handle the area.

00:14:17.911 --> 00:14:18.738
Be careful.

00:14:27.773 --> 00:14:30.025
Is that a tool that casts Shadow Magic?

00:14:46.534 --> 00:14:47.361
Come!

00:14:47.381 --> 00:14:49.501
You are taking more
than you can handle.

00:14:52.773 --> 00:14:54.040
Mo Fan! Faster!

00:14:54.140 --> 00:14:55.823
I'm at the entrance of the stage lift.

00:14:56.214 --> 00:14:57.187
There are some people here.

00:14:57.540 --> 00:14:59.683
There are crews surrounding
the celebrity.

00:14:59.935 --> 00:15:01.202
They're protecting her.

00:15:01.565 --> 00:15:03.273
-Don't tell me...
-Thank you for the support.

00:15:03.274 --> 00:15:04.273
Don't mention it.

00:15:05.795 --> 00:15:06.968
My lady,

00:15:06.995 --> 00:15:08.196
you must be careful.

00:15:08.469 --> 00:15:10.549
If something happens to the stage lift,

00:15:10.589 --> 00:15:12.599
the boss will kill me.

00:15:12.946 --> 00:15:13.708
It won't happen.

00:15:14.205 --> 00:15:14.874
Miss.

00:15:14.884 --> 00:15:16.067
Please control the lift well.

00:15:16.068 --> 00:15:17.798
Don't let our lady,Cucu fall down.

00:15:19.500 --> 00:15:20.135
Don't worry.

00:15:20.171 --> 00:15:21.584
It'll be fine.

00:15:21.965 --> 00:15:23.242
Miss, please ride the lift.

00:15:23.243 --> 00:15:24.602
Your performance is starting soon.

00:15:31.446 --> 00:15:32.072
Okay.

00:15:32.119 --> 00:15:32.870
The lift will descend now.

00:15:42.133 --> 00:15:43.019
Don't be nervous.

00:15:43.735 --> 00:15:44.827
It's a huge concert for me.

00:15:45.029 --> 00:15:46.349
Of course I'm nervous.

00:15:48.134 --> 00:15:49.494
But,

00:15:49.514 --> 00:15:52.009
I'm the main character today.

00:16:07.966 --> 00:16:09.185
My children!

00:16:09.186 --> 00:16:12.451
We can feast tonight!

00:16:12.686 --> 00:16:16.103
We must thank you for your concert!

00:16:53.246 --> 00:16:57.050
♪ Until we start to fight keep alive ♪

00:16:57.051 --> 00:17:00.278
♪ No matter what they said
you must believe in yourself ♪

00:17:00.304 --> 00:17:03.282
♪ You will breaking through the night ♪

00:17:03.295 --> 00:17:05.872
♪ Fire in your eyes shining so bright ♪

00:17:10.545 --> 00:17:12.800
♪ Every lonely journey I begin ♪

00:17:12.801 --> 00:17:14.861
♪ Is another mystery
this life gives me ♪

00:17:14.900 --> 00:17:17.015
♪ I can't escape my fate, but why? ♪

00:17:17.050 --> 00:17:20.283
♪ Who tipped the balance
of this season? ♪

00:17:20.773 --> 00:17:23.956
♪ Is the crushing blow necessary ♪

00:17:23.957 --> 00:17:25.551
♪ For one to rise up and see? ♪

00:17:25.578 --> 00:17:28.218
♪ Fight on in this uphill battle ♪

00:17:28.219 --> 00:17:30.496
♪ Face the reality ♪

00:17:30.517 --> 00:17:33.210
♪ Setting foot in this forbidden city ♪

00:17:33.237 --> 00:17:36.542
♪ Breaking the rules that silence me ♪

00:17:37.280 --> 00:17:38.591
♪ The more I go against it ♪

00:17:38.635 --> 00:17:40.024
♪ The more certain I am ♪

00:17:40.025 --> 00:17:42.139
♪ As I follow my heart ♪

00:17:42.863 --> 00:17:44.033
♪ The wind blows ♪

00:17:44.034 --> 00:17:46.309
♪ I am soaring into the sky ♪

00:17:46.310 --> 00:17:47.242
♪ As we meet ♪

00:17:47.243 --> 00:17:49.348
♪ One time you fight the fear ♪

00:17:49.349 --> 00:17:50.849
♪ Fly to high ♪

00:17:50.885 --> 00:17:54.348
♪ Every drop of sweat remembers
how you have tried ♪

00:17:54.391 --> 00:17:56.142
♪ You are born to be the one ♪

00:17:56.143 --> 00:17:58.063
♪ Who realize all desires ♪

00:17:58.064 --> 00:18:00.244
♪ Until we start to fight ♪

00:18:00.265 --> 00:18:01.569
♪ Keep alive ♪

00:18:01.570 --> 00:18:04.917
♪ No matter what they said
you must believe in yourself ♪

